201: 
202: \textbf{English:} Expand the field in cavity normal modes with boundary conditions (mirrors/BNI):
203: \begin{equation}
204: \hat{\Psi}(x,t) = \sum_n \frac{1}{\sqrt{2\omega_n}}\left(a_n u_n(x)e^{-i\omega_n t} + a_n^\dagger u_n^*(x)e^{i\omega_n t}\right)
205: \end{equation}
206: 
207: Where $u_n$ satisfies:
208: \begin{equation}
209: \left[-\frac{1}{2}\nabla^2 + V(|\Psi|^2) + \xi R\right]u_n = \omega_n^2 u_n
210: \end{equation}
211: 
212: With Dirichlet boundary conditions: $u_n|_{\partial V} = 0$
213: 
